# Default Parameters ⚙️

Parameters with default values automatically infer their type and are implicitly optional:

```typescript
function calculateDiscount(price: number, discountPercent: number = 10): number {
  return price - (price * (discountPercent / 100));
}

console.log("Default 10% off $100:", calculateDiscount(100)); // 90
console.log("Custom 25% off $100:", calculateDiscount(100, 25)); // 75
```

