# Typing Object Parameters Inline 📦

You can annotate object parameters directly in the function signature:

```typescript
function printCoordinates(pt: { x: number; y: number; label?: string }): void {
  console.log(`Point ${pt.label ?? ""}: [x=${pt.x}, y=${pt.y}]`);
}

printCoordinates({ x: 10, y: 20 });
printCoordinates({ x: 5, y: 15, label: "A" });
```

